+### Request access to the Payment Evaluation API or additional capabilities.
+
+Enter your email to request access.
+
+```bash
+curl https://docs.stripe.com/preview/register \
+  -X POST \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -H "Referer: https://docs.stripe.com/radar/multiprocessor" \
+  -d '{"email": "EMAIL", "preview": "radar_api_beta_preview"}'
+```
